00017: {"id":"UI67-U017","name":"硬编码基类结束与临时资源","sources":[{"repo":"/workspace/pokemon-essentials","commit":"8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b","tree":"7589c800b61ba13a13040ed0d686979b80a84fd0","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/004_Scene/007_Battle_Scene_BaseAnimation.rb","mode":"100644","bytes":45720,"sha256":"ab9473ac065f4a4270bcfd9e9b08911852be118aa43fcff85ba002efe28288cf","blob":"44508ddd1794b8d511d3b5c32bb0dd168c0310ee","reader":"/root/ui_full","status":"FULL_READ","ranges":[[1,823]],"whole_file_read":true,"lines":823,"semantic_selector":"Animation基类/ball辅助全部"}],"facts":[{"id":"UI67-F017-01","assertion":"基类初始化空picture/temps，donefalse，再createProcesses。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-02","assertion":"dispose只tempSprites逐个。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-03","assertion":"addSprite复制当前xy/visible/color/tone，PictureEx z来自原sprite。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-04","assertion":"addNewSprite先Picture登记再IconSprite.setBitmap后入temps。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-05","assertion":"update已done直接return。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-06","assertion":"先更新tempSprites。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-07","assertion":"仅原先p.running?才置finishedfalse/update/apply。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-08","assertion":"当最后process本轮完成，finished仍false，要下一update才done。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-09","assertion":"这与Evolution自身先update再查running不同消费者。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-10","assertion":"球图宽>=高才按半高一格裁。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-11","assertion":"静态trainer图宽<高*2不用手部追踪。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-12","assertion":"animatedtrainer依Leaf/Brendan/May三特例或默认coordSets。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-13","assertion":"球轨迹x线性y二次，midX未参与。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-14","assertion":"每1/20单位登记一段moveXY。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-15","assertion":"tumbling按球帧数转src并转3圈终角0。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-16","assertion":"ballOpenUp可6单位squish，再换open图/可SE。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-17","assertion":"battlerAppear先可见/opacity再5单位移位zoom，回调intro，10单位去色。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-18","assertion":"battlerAbsorb10单位着色再5单位缩小/隐藏。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-19","assertion":"15具名球着色+默认完整case实读。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-20","assertion":"16ballburst变体每14槽身份/tone与16capture变体17槽均本人全文逐项审读；具体tone为资源效果细节，不冒未经正式包批准的新像素义务。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-21","assertion":"ballburst普通10rays/15双粒子/2glare。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-22","assertion":"普通glare约19单位；Cherishray5tone轮换。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-23","assertion":"普通fallback变体POKEBALL。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-24","assertion":"capture9组粒子/3glare及ring，Master半径192其它144。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-25","assertion":"NetBall额外web。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-26","assertion":"capturefallbackPOKEBALL。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-27","assertion":"success三star12单位，先click/暗tone。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-28","assertion":"recall5粒子15单位并两个ring。"},{"id":"UI67-F017-29","assertion":"随机angle/zoom/radius调用不证明实际随机样本。"}],"reader":"/root/ui_full","premise":"固定B8/R合法普通战斗对象与默认配置，无插件并发；源请求不证明媒体/宿主，后段失败保留前缀且无通用ensure。","disposition":"OWN_FULL_DEPENDENCY_READ; domain callers/receivers separately received","execution":"NOT_EXECUTED"}
