7-F018-25","assertion":"派出隐藏原精灵/影子，图色后5zoom+10去色。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-26","assertion":"Recall先open/burst再吸收与shadowfade。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-27","assertion":"Damage按effectiveness0/1/2请求normal/weak/superSE。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-28","assertion":"Damage4轮各4单位，隐藏2再恢复2，末还原原visible。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-29","assertion":"Faintduration按cropY−top/8至少10单位。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-30","assertion":"faint优先_faintcry，其次正常cry75pitch。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-31","assertion":"哭声等待按cry_length×20ceil，无cry默认10，再加2。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-32","assertion":"faintshadow先hidden，个体掉落/裁底/淡后hidden并opacity复255。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-33","assertion":"Capture success基于原shakes>=4。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-34","assertion":"critical且shakes>0显示shake数1。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-35","assertion":"投捕弧16单位。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-36","assertion":"吸收5单位移位/zoom0/hidden，不给个体着色。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-37","assertion":"球关闭后critical额外摇摆。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-38","assertion":"落地4bounce时长4/4/3/2、分高1/2/4/8。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-39","assertion":"摇球min(displayShakes,3)轮。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-40","assertion":"成功successstar；失败open/burst/恢复原位个体与影子。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-41","assertion":"成功dispose把ball从temps转scene.captureBall。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-42","assertion":"失败ball仍temp随dispose。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-43","assertion":"Deflect16单位去+8单位反弹出屏。"},{"id":"UI67-F018-44","assertion":"所有名义单位非固定宿主帧数，素材失败前缀不保证回滚。"}],"reader":"/root/ui_full","premise":"固定B8/R合法普通战斗对象与默认配置，无插件并发；源请求不证明媒体/宿主，后段失败保留前缀且无通用ensure。","disposition":"OWN_FULL_DEPENDENCY_READ; domain callers/receivers separately received","execution":"NOT_EXECUTED"}
